			"Message": "style(Cocoon): Standardize ESBuild configuration formatting\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files in the `Configuration/` directory and `Source/ESBuild.js` to enforce consistent indentation, trailing commas, and import/export ordering.\n\nAdjust `Configuration/ESBuild/Cocoon.js` to align import statements and object literal definitions. Apply similar formatting rules to `Config/Base/Config.js`, `Config/Compile/Config.js`, `Constant/Environment/Constant.js`, `Target.js`, and `index.js`. Update `Configuration/Mountain/Config.js` to match the project's style standards for function definitions and configuration object properties.\n\nEnsure `Source/ESBuild.js` adheres to the same formatting conventions, including proper line breaks in environment checks and plugin definitions. These changes improve code readability and maintain alignment with the project's style guidelines without altering runtime behavior.",
